@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
allowmixing
title Proposed — Consistent backup set and isolated usable restore
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Required compatible recovery set" {
 database "Relational state / command / intent / reference ledger" as D
 folder "Private bytes / publication and actual-material manifests" as F
 folder "Native Git repositories / refs" as G
 rectangle "Configuration identities + usable protected keys" as K
}
rectangle "Actual coordinated capture procedure\nconsistent recoverable point / compatibility evidence" as C
rectangle "Independent protected recovery source\nnot configured by documented inventory" as B
rectangle "Isolated restore target\noutbound consequential effects disabled" as R
rectangle "Verify records / bytes / keys / refs / current authority\nrebuild derived cache; reconcile unresolved external effects" as V
rectangle "Actual scoped disposition\nusable result + measured loss/time + remaining limits" as O
D --> C
F --> C
G --> C
K --> C
C ..> B : only actual established usable mechanism
B ..> R : only authorized available source
R --> V
V --> O
note bottom of B
 Full / incremental / point-in-time capture are unselected implementation options.
 No schedule, RPO, RTO, destination or restore readiness established.
 Redundancy / replication is not sufficient proof of usable backup.
end note

@enduml